menu "Renesas Electronics Corporation Charger support"

config IDT_P9220
	tristate "IDT P9220 wireless charger"
	depends on I2C
	help
	  Enable support for the IDT P9220 wireless charging receiver.
	  The driver controls the receiver over I2C and reports charging
	  status through the power-supply framework.

endmenu
